      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# References\n\n```\nFile : txt2img-basic-fx10-gguf\nID   : T2I-BAS_FX10_GGUF\nT2I  : Text to image\nFX10 : Flux.1\nGGUF : GPT-Generated Unified Format\nCDL  : Clip Dual\n```\n# Models\n\n## GGUF Models\n\n📂 models / diffusion_models\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-dev-gguf/resolve/main/flux1-dev-Q8_0.gguf?download=true) flux1-dev-Q8_0.gguf [other versions](https://huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-dev-gguf/tree/main)\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-schnell-gguf/resolve/main/flux1-schnell-Q8_0.gguf?download=true) flux1-schnell-Q8_0.gguf [other versions](https://huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-schnell-gguf/tree/main)\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/FLUX.1-Krea-dev-GGUF/resolve/main/flux1-krea-dev-Q8_0.gguf?download=true) flux1-krea-dev-Q8_0.gguf [other versions](https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/FLUX.1-Krea-dev-GGUF/tree/main)\n\n## Dual Clip Loader (GGUF) \n\n📂 models / text_encoders\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/resolve/main/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf?download=true) t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf [other versions](https://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/tree/main) \n\n## VAE\n\n📂 models / vae\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Lumina_Image_2.0_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors?download=true) ae.safetensor\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/clip_l.safetensors?download=true)  clip_l.safetensor\n\n# Custom Nodes\n\n- [ComfyUI rgthree](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)\n- [ComfyUI Easy Use](https://github.com/yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use)\n- [ComfyUI Custom Scripts](https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts)\n- [ComfyUI TiledDiffusion](https://github.com/shiimizu/ComfyUI-TiledDiffusion)\n- [ComfyUI Image Size Tools](https://github.com/TheLustriVA/ComfyUI-Image-Size-Tools)\n- [ComfyUI GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF)\n- [ComfyUI TeaCache](https://github.com/welltop-cn/ComfyUI-TeaCache)\n\n# Resources\n- [Github](https://github.com/yaiol/ComfyUI-Workflows)\n\n\n\n\n"
